urrounding communities, and all over the world.\n\nEvery semester WTC welcomes a diverse group of students from across the United States and beyond. Each year, graduates typically include students from over 20 countries. At Western Texas College, students of all ages experience a unique opportunity to meet new people and expand their horizons while achieving their personal and professional goals.\n\nWTC also furnishes an invaluable benefit to graduates of Scurry County high schools: free college tuition. The Opportunity Tuition Waiver at WTC aims to lay a solid, educational foundation at no cost for students who meet some simple parameters. Contact WTC for more information.","rssUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCWzGojMzhqqb-VFllCzi3Gg","externalId":"UCWzGojMzhqqb-VFllCzi3Gg","keywords":"","ownerUrls":["http://www.youtube.com/@westerntexascollege"],"avatar":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_lQyjGRJqicRaCJjxjY15zeIdVXNRm4PkpKiGmI-Ub1t_o=s900-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","width":900,"height":900}]},"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWzGojMzhqqb-VFllCzi3Gg","isFamilySafe":true,"availableCountryCodes":["IS","AD","BW","TL","AS","GU","AO","BO","DE","KR","JM","TG","WS","MX","KM","MO","IR","TN","CV","NF","BF","RS","MN","FJ","SY","FO","MF","SM","DK","VU","QA","HN","UM","NU","CR","GA","AZ","DM","IN","BJ","CC","RU","RO","LK","ZM","UZ","HU","LR","GH","MQ","NG","KW","CZ","PK","NL","PN","CA","MD","GG","BL","FM","SR","VI","IL","KG","MZ","ME","CU","TJ","LY","HR","NC","MW","PH","TZ","TH","AI","ES","SB","BV","VA","BH","AU","MM","SJ","VN","GF","LI","PW","MC","HT","PG","NE","BQ","ZW","DJ","BD","HK","GM","GE","FR","GW","BY","MK","SZ","AR","IT","LS","UY","YT","NO","SD","PS","MA","VG","SE","ML","TM","PT","SI","SO","GQ","TR","PM","PY","UA","YE","TO","CO","ST","BG","LU","IM","SX","TV","NI","GS","AW","GN","CX","KI","BS","DZ","AT","MG","ZA","BE","GL","JE","TK","RE","DO","PL","AL","TD","CY","GI","BN","NZ","CM","BB","KZ","AG","PA"